# Bot2's own Sol Ring is taken by Bot1's Dack Fayden (-2), so Bot1 controls it. Bot2 then targets it with Price of Freedom: an
# artifact an opponent controls, though Bot2 owns it. "Its controller" is Bot1, who is asked and fetches a tapped Mountain;
# Bot2 (the caster) draws, and the Sol Ring goes to its owner's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Island
Dack Fayden
Island x3
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Sol Ring
Price of Freedom
Mountain x4
Mountain
Island
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dack Fayden.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Dack Fayden.Activate(Ability: Gain control; Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Price of Freedom.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search(Mountain)

[Expect]
Turn = 6
Bot2.Graveyard = Price of Freedom; Sol Ring
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Island; Mountain; Mountain; Dack Fayden
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Tapped = true
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
